{
 "_doc": "Wilderness set pieces, round 5: the Silver Run state fish hatchery, a trout hatchery on a forest creek the Cordon used as a water-testing post. Route: the track to the front of the raceway shed (boarded, the Cordon's notice) -> round by the creek -> over a pony wall into the shed (the crew: ambush on entering, and on the jaws in the dip nets) -> up the creek walkway past the headbox (two lying still) -> over the pony wall to the creek bank -> up the ladder onto the intake dam's catwalk -> Sato at the sampler, the lab key (taking it wakes the two by the headbox) -> back down -> the manager's cottage (the house key on the table, June in the bedroom) -> the hatch house door (deadbolt, the house key) -> the office's loose boards (the techs) -> the incubation room, the Cordon's field lab (the techs) -> the chiller door (padlock, the lab key; a can chime) -> Lieutenant Okonkwo (guardian) and the cache -> the chiller's bolted back door. Props: props/wild5_hatchery.json. The creek, the dam and the weir are props on the levelled pad (site waterside: the real stream runs 60 m off; no keep_water).",
